US EPA, Office of Water. EPA 815-R-06-009, November 2005, 332 PDF pages. [Agency index](https://www.epa.gov/dwreginfo/long-term-2-enhanced-surface-water-treatment-rule-documents) · [Official text](https://nepis.epa.gov/Exe/ZyPURL.cgi?Dockey=901V0500.TXT) · [PDF](https://nepis.epa.gov/Exe/ZyPDF.cgi/901V0500.PDF?Dockey=901V0500.PDF).

Read the whole manual progressively: technology overview, challenge testing, direct integrity tests, indirect monitoring, pilot testing, design and implementation. Use chapters 3–5 to compare evidence for removal with evidence that a unit remains intact. Chapter 6 supports the pilot-study work. Its cover says November 2005 despite the “06” in the report identifier.

Checked 30 October 2026: official index, text, cover metadata and selected testing/pilot sections. Public reading is available; keep contractor, illustration and third-party credits rather than assuming a blanket open-content licence. Its US regulatory examples are historical context; use current jurisdictional requirements for an actual installation.
